56w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FKPa!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa6cfe7ad-8010-4668-83d5-86fdb4c7fff7_1536x1024.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FKPa!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa6cfe7ad-8010-4668-83d5-86fdb4c7fff7_1536x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FKPa!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa6cfe7ad-8010-4668-83d5-86fdb4c7fff7_1536x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FKPa!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa6cfe7ad-8010-4668-83d5-86fdb4c7fff7_1536x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FKPa!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa6cfe7ad-8010-4668-83d5-86fdb4c7fff7_1536x1024.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></source></picture></div></a></figure></div><h6>Sorry for all the emails this week, but also not sorry.  I’m enjoying myself. So mute me or unsubscribe, because the spice will continue to flow  !! <br><br>Now unto the article we goooooo…</h6><div><hr></div><p><em>Imagine if you could read Zuck’s diary… Or Peter Thiel’s emails? What if all of Elon and Altman’s dirty laundry — their text messages — were available for public review? If only there was a place to study how Steve Jobs politicked. How he kept talent at Apple. </em></p><p>Shock. Intrigue. Horror. Capitalism. Money. Greed. </p><p>Directionally good or bad?</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOtM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a25b954-9d2e-4bfa-b179-2e7adbef6ea8_1090x274.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOtM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a25b954-9d2e-4bfa-b179-2e7adbef6ea8_1090x274.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOtM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a25b954-9d2e-4bfa-b179-2e7adbef6ea8_1090x274.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOtM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a25b954-9d2e-4bfa-b179-2e7adbef6ea8_1090x274.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOtM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a25b954-9d2e-4bfa-b179-2e7adbef6ea8_1090x274.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOtM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a25b954-9d2e-4bfa-b179-2e7adbef6ea8_1090x274.png\" width=\"1090\" height=\"274\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOtM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a25b954-9d2e-4bfa-b179-2e7adbef6ea8_1090x274.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOtM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a25b954-9d2e-4bfa-b179-2e7adbef6ea8_1090x274.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOtM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a25b954-9d2e-4bfa-b179-2e7adbef6ea8_1090x274.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOtM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a25b954-9d2e-4bfa-b179-2e7adbef6ea8_1090x274.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></source></picture></div></a></figure></div><p>Directionally salacious.</p><p>Today’s Kurate is about the Epstein files for the venture-backed.</p><p>Literotica for the technium.</p><h2><strong>KURATE #4 – INTERNAL TECH EMAILS</strong></h2><p>The best place to find gossip is not your workplace’s water cooler nor your neighbor’s front porch.</p><p>It is on <a href=\"https://www.techemails.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Internal Tech Emails</a>. ( <span class=\"mention-wrap\"></span> )</p><h3><strong>There are storylines to match any corporate kink found in this archive.</strong></h3><p>IP infringement between Google and Apple? Broken non-disclosure agreements? Zuckerberg and Bezos plans for world domination? Elon making fun of both OpenAI and Anthropic? Microsoft and Instagram and Uber and Waymo shenanigans? Elizabeth Holmes’ emails are there, so are Sam Bankman-Fried’s.</p><p>Internal Tech Emails is a weekly newsletter that goes into the court filings of the world and curates the tea, with a specific focus on technology gossip.</p><h2>The world is literally run by the people writing these messages.</h2><p>Below are a few Kurate recommendations. Though I recommend reading the entire files and paying for this.</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.techemails.com/p/steve-jobs-emails-adobes-ceo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Most Bone-Chilling Email in the History of Adobe</a>… Court